  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support Women`s Initiatives 2022-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d Women`s Initiatives 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is expected to contribute at the reduction of gender based-violence, hate crime and human trafficking in the eastern region of Moldova, called left bank of Nistru river and Transnistrian region.

The objectives to be supported in 2022-2026 are the following:
- Increase internal effectiveness and sustainability of Women&apos;s Initiatives;
- Increase protection of rights holders (victims of domestic violence and victims of trafficking) and refugees;
- Reduce the level of tolerance of society to negative stereotypes associated with domestic violence and human trafficking among men and women, boys and girls, and duty-bearers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Women`s Initiatives f&#xf6;rslag till finansiering f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r den Strategiska planen uppfyller kraven i till&#xe4;mpliga best&#xe4;mmelser. WI har uppn&#xe5;tt betydande resultat i organiserande utveckling och implementationen av uppdraget under det f&#xf6;rra f&#xf6;rberedande k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d, d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r har ambassaden best&#xe4;mt sig f&#xf6;r att forts&#xe4;tta med partnerskapet.

`Womens`s Initiatives` f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s beviljas st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att forts&#xe4;tta den institutionella utvecklingen, f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att organisationen fungerar p&#xe5; ett transparent, effektivt och uppdragsdrivet s&#xe4;tt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women`s Initiatives proposal for funding to implement core support for the Strategic Plan fulfils the requirements in applicable provisions. WI achieved outstanding results in organizational development and implementation of its mission during previous pre core support, therefore the Embassy decided to continue this partnership. 
`Womens`s Initiatives` will be granted to continue institutional developments to ensure a transparent, efficient and mission driven functioning.</narrative>
  </description>
